    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Once Glorious Artahk</i>, you\u2019ll explore the ruins of the ancient city of Artahk in search of a way to save the world from an endless night. Solve a variety of different puzzles to unlock new paths, abilities, and forgotten lore, then read the lost stories you uncover to gain insight into a tangled web of mysteries. Using only your wits and your trusty torch to guide you, you must find a way to return light to a starless sky.\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crumbling ruins, darkened halls, and tangled forests as you scour what remains of the once-glorious city of Artahk. The game world is divided into five distinct zones that can be explored non-linearly and feature many puzzles that overlap and build upon each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.poster.avif?t=1738880797\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.webm?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.mp4?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From piecing together the proper sequence to arrange ancient runes, to deciphering cryptic murals, or using mirrors to redirect the light from your torch in order to activate magical mechanisms, the ruins of Artahk are littered with all manner of puzzles waiting to be solved.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/2e6e5297ff84a3c20bb73b946d92ea91.poster.avif?t=1738880797\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/2e6e5297ff84a3c20bb73b946d92ea91.webm?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/2e6e5297ff84a3c20bb73b946d92ea91.mp4?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK ANCIENT LORE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the magical Tome of Apocrypha, you\u2019ll uncover long forgotten stories that will give you insight into the many mysteries of Artahk. All you need to do is discover the right \u201cwords of power\u201d hidden throughout the city. The lore presented here is more than just set dressing\u2014you\u2019ll need to use what you learn from the Tome to solve certain puzzles and piece together a way to restore the stars to the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/1b3210bb37e4e2168f5d10d187abd886.poster.avif?t=1738880797\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/1b3210bb37e4e2168f5d10d187abd886.webm?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/1b3210bb37e4e2168f5d10d187abd886.mp4?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 5 major zones and several subzones</strong> throughout the city, each interconnected and filled to the brim with puzzles waiting to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the dreaded beast</strong> that prowls the ruins of the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat</strong>\u2014you must rely on your wits alone to survive and find victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover 90+ lore entries</strong> within the Tome of Apocrypha, short stories that will give you insight into the many mysteries of Artahk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 4 exciting abilities to augment your torch</strong> and open up new paths and possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the tangled mystery</strong> of why the world was cast into an endless night, and how the stars can be returned to the sky once more</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Once Glorious Artahk</i>, you\u2019ll explore the ruins of the ancient city of Artahk in search of a way to save the world from an endless night. Solve a variety of different puzzles to unlock new paths, abilities, and forgotten lore, then read the lost stories you uncover to gain insight into a tangled web of mysteries. Using only your wits and your trusty torch to guide you, you must find a way to return light to a starless sky.\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crumbling ruins, darkened halls, and tangled forests as you scour what remains of the once-glorious city of Artahk. The game world is divided into five distinct zones that can be explored non-linearly and feature many puzzles that overlap and build upon each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.poster.avif?t=1738880797\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.webm?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390310/extras/3e6f2d3d1474f15844ef02ed0271aa23.mp4?t=1738880797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From piecing together the proper sequence to arrange ancient runes, to deciphering cryptic murals, or using mirrors to redirect the light from your torch in order to activate magical mechanisms, the ruins of Artahk are littered with all manner of puzzles waiting to be solved.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https