</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the dreaded beast</strong> that prowls the ruins of the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat</strong>\u2014you must rely on your wits alone to survive and find victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover 90+ lore entries</strong> within the Tome of Apocrypha, short stories that will give you insight into the many mysteries of Artahk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 4 exciting abilities to augment your torch</strong> and open up new paths and possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the tangled mystery</strong> of why the world was cast into an endless night, and how the stars can be returned to the sky once more</p></li></ul>",
